WEBVTT

00:17:28.254 --> 00:17:32.075
considerada pela Associação Vexilológica
Norte-americana

00:17:32.075 --> 00:17:36.001
a pior bandeira municipal
da América do Norte.

00:17:36.971 --> 00:17:39.964
(Risos)

00:17:43.981 --> 00:17:44.981
Pois.

00:17:46.247 --> 00:17:49.740
Aquilo tem o símbolo
de marca registada, pessoal.

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:50.838
(Risos

00:17:50.838 --> 00:17:53.550
Magoa-me só de olhar.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.640
Muito obrigado pela atenção.

00:17:55.907 --> 00:17:59.388
(Aplausos)